<title>USA: Entergy Corp Q3 shr with gains $1.22.</title>
<headline>Entergy Corp Q3 shr with gains $1.22.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.22		    $1.16</p>
<p> Net			279,880		  263,120</p>
<p> Revs		   2,138,270		1,955,020</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 228,604		  227,751</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.67		    $2.27</p>
<p> Net			381,130		  516,210</p>
<p> Revs		   5,589,790		4,857,340</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 228,142		  227,639</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Unusual items included in third quarter figures include after-tax gains of $6.5 million from the sale of stock in the Pakistan Hub River project and $941,000 from a sale by Entergy Power Inc of 84 megawatts of generating capacity to an Arkansas municipality.  </p>
<p>After removing unusual charges and credits, third-quarter 1996 net income was $251.1 million, compared with $263.5 million a year ago. Ongoing earnings per share were $1.10, compared with $1.16.</p>
</text>
